          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean goobiida Arpakshadi ng'eanyiida iing'ata jeata jih Shela gweanyeew bughalaji ang'wan ea samwagu, ak gwaji orju suuk ea haweega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
