          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh jeacheenga Dera gil. Dera gwaji Abramu ea Nahori ea Harani; nea Harani ea ghweanda Lutuhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harani goosheedeawa ghweandaanyi was Dera miyeeda aba ng'eang'da nyaawa sijiilsa, was Uru mida ng'eanyiida Galdayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu gageeshi Abramu ea Nahori; gheawunga gatmooda Abramu geeguura Sarayi nea gheawunga gatmooda Nahori geeguura Milka, was hudeaba Harani was ghweanda Milka sea Iska. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Sarayi soonooda gil; miighwanyas baleanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
